+namespace meridian::workbench {
+
+// Personal hubs: a folder of posts, notes or code worked on with coding
+// agents through AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md conventions. Creating one only writes
+// inside a NEW folder (or an empty one) under a parent the person picked in a
